.SH "Opis szczegółowy"
.PP 

.SH "tinyglobby"
.PP
\fR\fP \fR\fP

.PP
A fast and minimal alternative to globby and fast-glob, meant to behave the same way\&.

.PP
Both globby and fast-glob present some behavior no other globbing lib has, which makes it hard to manually replace with something smaller and better\&.

.PP
This library uses only two subdependencies, compared to \fRglobby\fP's \fR23\fP and \fRfast-glob\fP's \fR17\fP\&.
.SH "Usage"
.PP
.PP
.nf
import { glob, globSync } from 'tinyglobby';

await glob(['files/*\&.ts', '!**/*\&.d\&.ts'], { cwd: 'src' });
globSync('src/**/*\&.ts', { ignore: '**/*\&.d\&.ts' });
.fi
.PP
